  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien KTV duet over an upbeat swung two-step. A synth bass bouncing a two-step on root and fifth; a shuffled drum kit with a cross-stick backbeat; DX-style electric piano comping; clean chorus-effect guitar fills answering each vocal line; an alto sax playing the intro and interlude hook; the final chorus modulates up a whole step. Bright, clean karaoke-bar mix, both voices centred and forward, sax and guitar fills to the sides. A male baritone and a female soprano trading lines and teasing each other in the verses, harmonising in parallel thirds on the chorus. 104 BPM, F major. Playful bickering, twenty years in love. No sobbing enka delivery, no slow ballad tempo, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no rap, no EDM drop.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n透早四點半 鐵板先燒\n蛋餅 一塊一塊 煎甲赤赤\n你徛佇櫃台 喙笑笑\n逐个 攏喝「帥哥 欲食啥?」\n\n[Verse]\n你莫佇遐 咧食醋\n彼个帥哥 七十八歲\n做生理 喙就愛甜\n你看 蛋餅閣煎甲臭火焦\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你逐个 攏叫帥哥\n啊無 是欲叫啥?\n\n[Chorus]\n帥哥 欲食啥 免客氣\n一个喝單 一个煎 二十冬矣\n鐵板燒燒 奶茶甜甜\n你的喙 比奶茶閣較甜\n\n[Verse]\n二十年前 你來買蛋餅\n我煎甲臭火焦 你嘛食了了\n是你 偷加我兩粒卵\n閣無收錢 喝我「美女」\n\n[Chorus]\n帥哥 欲食啥 免客氣\n一个喝單 一个煎 二十冬矣\n鐵板燒燒 奶茶甜甜\n臭火焦的 我嘛食二十冬\n\n[Bridge]\n其實彼工 看你看甲 袂記得翻面\n其實 我叫遐濟帥哥 攏是咧練習叫你\n\n[Chorus]\n帥哥 欲食啥 免客氣\n一个喝單 一个煎 二十冬矣\n鐵板燒燒 奶茶甜甜\n這聲帥哥 今仔日 是叫你\n\n[Outro]\n帥哥 欲食啥?\n一份蛋餅 加兩粒卵",
